            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made these for a cookie exchange. Didn't use jam and replaced the shortening with butter. I also put milk chocolate chips in the middle as soon as they came out of the oven! I used my homemade peanut butter because it doesn't have added sugar like most commercial brands do. Super recipe! Thank you!",
            "datePublished": "2013-12-06T17:14:31.650Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
