            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Mrs Buttercup"
            },
            "reviewBody": "These cookies are simple to make, very peanut buttery and I have made them with butter, margarine and shortening - I recommend using what the recipe originally called for - shortening; they really turned out best that way. I also found using Strawberry or Grape jam (not jelly) makes the best flavor combo.",
            "datePublished": "2014-08-04T12:37:12.113Z"
