              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "missrochester"
            },
            "reviewBody": "my Husband LOVES peanut butter cookies so I thought i would give these a try! Excellent cookies!considering i had to use margarine instead of shortening.mine turned out a little flat due to my substitution but still Delicious! if you use Margarine these make the Best Chewy soft peanut butter cookies yummmm very rich!",
            "datePublished": "2013-05-01T13:01:19.880Z"
